    "source_text": "4-chloro-6,7-difluoroquinolin-2(1H)-one (100 mg, 0.46 mmol) was taken in a microwave tube. Added ((2S,4R)-4-amino-2-methylpiperidin-1-yl)(5-chloro-1-methyl-1H-pyrazol-4-yl)methanone 2,2,2-trifluoroacetate (172 mg, 0.46 mmol), followed by the addition of Palladium (II) acetate (10.41 mg, 0.05 mmol), racemic-2,2'-Bis(diphenylphosphino)-1,1'-binaphthyl (28.9 mg, 0.05 mmol), Cesium carbonate (111 mL, 1.39 mmol), N,N'-Diisopropylethylamine (242 mL, 1.39 mmol).  toluene (10 mL) was added and subjected to microwave with the following parameters.  Temperature 140 °C  Time 60 minutes  After the completion of the reaction, dissolved the compound in methanol and purified by column  ",
